    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 类人生物（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 45；''重伤'' 22</span><span>''先攻'' +3</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 13，''强韧'' 16，''反射'' 15，''意志'' 14</span><span>''侦查'' +2</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6（沼泽行者）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}毒素灵气</div>\n<div class=description>灵气 1；所有在该灵气内的敌人对持续毒素伤害的豁免受到-2 减值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}巨木棒（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+5 vs. AC<br>命中：2d6+3 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/range}}标枪（毒素，武器）✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：射程 10/20，+5 vs. AC<br>命中：1d6+3 伤害，以及 5 点持续毒素伤害（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}毒尾（毒素）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+4 vs. AC<br>命中：目标受到 5 点持续毒素伤害（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+9</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 17（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 14（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 12（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+3）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+0）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 龙语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 巨木棒，标枪</span></div></div>\n</div>",
